            <ArticleTitle>[The &quot;wandering spleen&quot; syndrome].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>366-8, 418</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe a 26-year-old woman with thrombocytopenia discovered during gestation. On admission for evaluation of abdominal pain, torsion of an ectopic spleen was found. The spleen was removed and the thrombocytopenia resolved.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
